{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J9xaVrXML21795083213.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智作供時提及，2015年8月，因為涉及罪行，要坐「大飛」前往內地，其後用相同方法，往返內地和香港，每次都是包船，費用是10萬元，自己有能力支付。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207241-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E4%BE%9B%E7%A8%B1%E8%AD%9A%E6%96%B9%E9%A7%BF%E9%8D%BE%E6%84%8F%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%89%E5%80%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%80%E9%BD%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智供稱譚方駿鍾意自己　「所以三個人就一齊」</a></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超在深圳出席亞太經濟合作組織(APEC)領導人非正式會議，期間與多位成員經濟體領袖會面。他表示，與智利總統共同見證簽署工作假期計劃協議，香港青年可獲一年工作假期簽證，為香港首次與拉丁美洲國家合作推出工作假期計劃 。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207228-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E8%88%87%E6%99%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%B0%BD%E7%BD%B2%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%83%E5%8D%94%E8%AD%B0%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%AF%E7%8D%B2%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E7%B0%BD%E8%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李家超：與智利簽署工作假期計劃協議　香港青年可獲一年簽證</a></p><p></p><p>受強烈東北季候風影響，早上氣溫轉涼。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207199-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E6%97%A9%E4%B8%8A%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E8%BD%89%E6%B6%BC%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E9%A0%90%E6%B8%AC%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E9%80%90%E6%BC%B8%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%E8%87%B3%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E7%B4%8418%E5%BA%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣｜早上氣溫轉涼　天文台預測氣溫逐漸下降至午夜最低約18度</a></p><p></p><p>巴拿馬當局完成審查長和集團子公司的港口特許經營合約，發現公司與當地政府前官員可能涉嫌違規，將提出刑事訴訟。長和集團早前啟動國際仲裁程序，向巴拿馬當局索償。</p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207183-%E5%B7%B4%E6%8B%BF%E9%A6%AC%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%AF%A9%E6%9F%A5%E9%95%B7%E5%92%8C%E5%AD%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E7%89%B9%E8%A8%B1%E7%B6%93%E7%87%9F%E5%90%88%E7%B4%84%E7%A8%B1%E6%88%96%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E9%81%95%E8%A6%8F%E5%B0%87%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A8%B4%E8%A8%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> 巴拿馬完成審查長和子公司港口特許經營合約　稱或涉嫌違規將提出刑事訴訟</a></p><p></p><p>警方搗破兩個電話詐騙中心，更發現騙徒改用固網電話行騙，懷疑是逃避電話卡實名制措施。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207234-%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E6%90%97%E7%A0%B4%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%9B%BB%E9%A8%99%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E7%99%BC%E7%8F%BE%E9%A8%99%E5%BE%92%E6%94%B9%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BA%E7%B6%B2%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%B1%E8%A1%8C%E9%A8%99%E7%96%91%E9%80%83%E9%81%BF%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%B1%E5%8D%A1%E5%AF%A6%E5%90%8D%E5%88%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">警方搗破兩個電騙中心　發現騙徒改用固網電話行騙疑逃避電話卡實名制</a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:03:54.349348+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":525,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.138128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:57:16.589008+00:00","content_hash":"1fd5cc2fdf105ea611fb59009c1aa9511facc4a9f3fea213437ef966780a057d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:03:54.349348+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}